{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/05/21/6496367/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、乃木どこの収録だったよ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日村さん、お誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/05/21/6496367/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでお祝いしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！これ、新制服です！\n夏って感じ！！！o(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの大好きな夏が来る！！！！わいわいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、こないだの握手会でも生誕祭がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なあちゃん\nれいか\nせいらりん\nれなちちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Happy Birthday！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(自称)華の94年組のみんなも、\nもお成人だねー(* ^_^ *)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年で、学校も仕事も共に励み、共に青春時代を過ごしてきた仲間たちが、十代を卒業していくのはなんだか感慨深いなあ...。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃 思い描いてた二十歳って、\nもっとずっと大人だと思ってたけど、\nまだまだ未熟で、まだまだ助けが必要なのでござるな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、これからも助けあって支えあって、\nお互い、成長し続けていけたらいいなっ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私たちをこれからもよろしくね(o^^o)◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、早朝から撮影だったよー♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/05/21/6496367/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりこういう日は、\nゴロゴロ雲を呼び寄せてしまうのか\nわたしは！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、雨やら風やらすごかったけど、大丈夫でしたかー(*_*）？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、夕暮れの雲は\nモクモクしてて、度事無くキレイだったよ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/05/21/6496367/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(。・ω・。)正義！"}],"source":"archive"}